cburnett chess piece set
========================

Files: wK.svg wQ.svg wR.svg wB.svg wN.svg wP.svg bK.svg bQ.svg bR.svg bB.svg bN.svg bP.svg

Author: Colin M.L. Burnett (User:Cburnett on Wikimedia Commons)
License: GNU General Public License, version 2 or later (GPLv2+)
         https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html

This is the "cburnett" set used by Lichess (see lila's COPYING.md, which lists it
as GPLv2+). The SVGs here were extracted unmodified from the base64 data URIs in
chessground's assets/chessground.cburnett.css (chessground 9.2.1, GPL-3.0-or-later,
https://github.com/lichess-org/chessground).

No chess.com assets are used.
